🚀 STEP 1: AWS pe server banana (VPS)

👉 Open: AWS
Login karo

Steps:
Search: EC2
Click: Launch Instance
Fill karo:
Name: genesis-server
OS: Ubuntu
Instance: t2.micro (FREE)
🔑 STEP 2: Key create (MOST IMPORTANT)

👉 "Create key pair" pe click karo

Name: genesis-key
Download .pem file

👉 File download hogi:

genesis-key.pem

💡 Ye hi:
👉 Private Key (isse login karoge)

🌐 STEP 3: Server IP milega

Instance create hone ke baad:

👉 EC2 dashboard me dikhega:

Public IP: 3.110.xxx.xxx

👉 Ye hi:
👉 VPS HOST/IP

👤 STEP 4: Login karo server me

Apne PC me terminal kholo:

chmod 400 genesis-key.pem

ssh -i genesis-key.pem ubuntu@3.110.xxx.xxx

👉 Ho gaya login 🎉

🌍 STEP 5: Domain lena (VERY EASY)

👉 Buy from:

Namecheap

Example:

genesis.app
🌐 STEP 6: Domain ko server se connect karo

Domain dashboard me jao → DNS settings

Add karo:

Type: A
Name: app
Value: 3.110.xxx.xxx

Type: A
Name: api
Value: 3.110.xxx.xxx

👉 Result:

app.genesis.app
api.genesis.app
⚙️ STEP 7: Ye ENV values fill karo
DOCKER_CLOUD_DEPLOY_DOMAIN=app.genesis.app
DOCKER_CLOUD_API_DOMAIN=api.genesis.app
DOCKER_CLOUD_SSL_EMAIL=hrishi@genesis.app

👉 Ye tum manually likhte ho

🔒 STEP 8: HTTPS (SSL enable)

Server me run karo:

sudo apt update
sudo apt install nginx certbot python3-certbot-nginx -y

sudo certbot --nginx -d app.genesis.app -d api.genesis.app

👉 Ab site HTTPS ho jayegi 🔥

🧠 FINAL SAMJH (1 line me)

👉 AWS deta hai:

Server (IP)

👉 Tum karte ho:

Key create
Domain connect
SSL enable
⚡ VISUAL FLOW
Laptop → SSH Key → AWS Server (IP)
↓
Domain (app/api)
↓
HTTPS (SSL)
🔥 TERE LIYE NEXT STEP

Agar tu Genesis.ai bana raha hai:

👉 bol: “Auto deploy system banana hai”

Main tujhe sikhaunga:

GitHub se auto deploy
user ko live URL dena
Render jaisa system 🚀
